          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reacción: Has declarado una habilidad **^^Combatir^^** para esta unidad</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **^^Ciudades de Sigmar Duardin^^** unit that has not used a **^^Combatir^^** ability this turn and is within this unit&apos;s combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Combatir^^** ability immediately after the **^^Combatir^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved.</characteristic>
